      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Lyudochka Snezhevna: Efim Snezhevich",
      "content": "Efim, called 'Teacher', is a Snezhevich raised in the House of the Hearth. He sent Lyudochka and other agents to Inazuma to restart the Shogunate-Watatsumi war by poisoning Watatsumi Island. He gave her 'Final Instructions' after losing patience and was fooled by the faked death. He was recalled to Snezhnaya and his true aims are not known.",
