        "Momoyo"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Lyudochka Snezhevna: Momoyo",
      "content": "Momoyo is a Shuumatsuban agent who first posed as Gendou Ringo. She faked her own death after the Traveler's fortune-slip quests, then helped fake Lyudochka's, was captured and lost an eye, and told the Traveler to let Lyudochka keep the Ringo name. She brushes off thanks and says the Shuumatsuban should pay for her injury.",
