      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Lyudochka Snezhevna: Katarina",
      "content": "Katarina is a Fatui agent met in the Chasm: Underground Mines who calls Lyudochka a friend closer than a sister. She says Lyudochka is serious on the surface but funny. After the fortune slip quests she is relieved to hear Lyudochka escaped.",
